            <li><strong>Opens in your model</strong> \u2014 prompt cards and the Prompt Builder compose a prompt and open it in the platform you choose: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity, Copilot, or Google AI Mode. Those responses come from that platform, not from this site.</li>
